# `C108`'s third column. `web-storefront.config` plus the `allow hosts` an absolute target requires
# — a separate file rather than a line added there, so the diagonal's two inputs stay byte-identical
# and the committed census baseline keeps reproducing.

env local default
  api "http://localhost:4001/v1"
  web "http://localhost:8090"
  allow hosts "localhost"
